sequenceDiagram
    actor You
    participant UI as forge CLI or dashboard
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant W as Design-flow worker (Temporal)
    participant A as Agent
    participant T as Tools (MCP)
    participant TW as Digital twin

    You->>UI: forge design "a goal"
    UI->>GW: POST /v1/runs
    GW->>W: start the workflow
    loop each phase of the flow
        W->>A: run the phase
        A->>T: call tools
        T-->>A: results
        A->>TW: record drafts
        W->>GW: open the gate
        GW-->>You: review on Approvals or in the CLI
        You->>GW: approve, retry, rework or reject
        GW->>TW: approved drafts become the baseline
    end
    W-->>GW: run complete
    GW-->>UI: results and the run record
